---
layout: base.njk
navKey: events
metaTitle: "Live Music & Events in Watertown NY | Phi Gallery"
description: "Upcoming live music, exhibit openings, workshops, sound healing, and markets at Phi Gallery — 88 Public Square, downtown Watertown, NY."
breadcrumbs:
  - label: Home
    url: /
  - label: Events
---
<section class="section wrap">
  <header class="stack" style="margin-bottom: var(--sp-5);">
    <p class="kicker">The heartbeat of Phi Gallery</p>
    <h1 class="display" style="font-size: var(--fs-3xl);">Events &amp; Live Music</h1>
    <p class="lede">Live shows, exhibit openings, workshops, sound healing, and the makers' market — on Public Square in downtown Watertown.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="section-head"><h2>Upcoming</h2></div>
  {%- if collections.upcomingEvents.length %}
  <div class="grid grid--3">
    {%- for event in collections.upcomingEvents %}
      {%- set card = event %}
      {% include "partials/event-card.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  {%- else %}
  <p class="empty-state">Nothing on the calendar at the moment — new shows go up all the time. Follow <a href="{{ site.instagramUrl }}">@{{ settings.instagram | replace('@','') }}</a> so you don't miss the next one.</p>
  {%- endif %}

  {%- if collections.pastEvents.length %}
  <div class="section-head" style="margin-top: var(--sp-6);"><h2>Past events</h2></div>
  <div>
    {%- for event in collections.pastEvents %}
      {%- set card = event %}
      {% include "partials/event-row.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  {%- endif %}
</section>
